1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,884
For the members themselves, the period demanded a specific kind of discipline.

2
00:00:04,884 --> 00:00:16,134
Six teenagers, some of them fifteen and sixteen, answering interview questions about a seventh member they shared a dorm practice schedule with — day after day, market after market.

3
00:00:16,134 --> 00:00:24,858
Their collective answer became a running theme of the debut era: she is part of this, the formation is temporary, the group is seven.

4
00:00:24,858 --> 00:00:30,386
Said differently by every member, in every language, for four straight months.

